a[k+1];break;case "id":case "width":case "height":case "align":case "vspace":case "hspace":case "class":case "title":case "accesskey":case "name":case "tabindex":h.embedAttrs[a[k]]=h.objAttrs[a[k]]=a[k+1];break;default:h.embedAttrs[a[k]]=h.params[a[k]]=a[k+1]}h.objAttrs.classid=f;e&&(h.embedAttrs.type=e);return h}function getFooprintDataJSON(){return encode_deviceprint()}
